{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016t7SndWS2PxZyGaLRrq7WM","type":"tool_result","content":"333\t## Performance Considerations\n334\t\n335\t1. **Connection Pooling**: Configure connection pooling for better performance:\n336\t   ```typescript\n337\t   const prisma = new PrismaClient({\n338\t     log: ['query', 'info', 'warn', 'error'],\n339\t     datasources: {\n340\t       db: {\n341\t         url: process.env.DATABASE_URL + '&connection_limit=20'\n342\t       }\n343\t     }\n344\t   });\n345\t   ```\n346\t\n347\t2. **Query Optimization**: Use `select` to fetch only needed fields:\n348\t   ```typescript\n349\t   const user = await prisma.user.findUnique({\n350\t     where: { id: 1 },\n351\t     select: {\n352\t       id: true,\n353\t       name: true,\n354\t       email: true\n355\t     }\n356\t   });\n357\t   ```\n358\t\n359\t## Next Steps\n360\t\n361\t- [Prisma ORM Documentation](/orm/v7)\n362\t- [Prisma Schema Reference](/orm/v7/reference/prisma-schema-reference)\n363\t- [Prisma Client API Reference](/orm/v7/reference/prisma-client-reference)\n364\t- [Prisma Migrate Guide](/orm/v7/prisma-migrate)\n365\t- [Prisma Studio](https://www.prisma.io/studio)\n366\t\n367\t## Getting Help\n368\t\n369\tIf you encounter issues during migration:\n370\t1. Search the [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/prisma/prisma/issues)\n371\t2. Ask for help in the [Prisma Slack](https://slack.prisma.io/)\n372\t3. Open a [GitHub Discussion](https://github.com/prisma/prisma/discussions)"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"108ea6bf-f03b-4a5b-a7b7-bed457d824b2","uuid":"0a6d80dd-84c1-44a8-a55e-aaac085ef228","timestamp":"2026-09-27T09:30:40.811Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/jcarr/.cache/markdownattractor/bench/t4/grep/src/apps/docs/content/docs/guides/upgrade-prisma-orm/v1.mdx","content":"## Performance Considerations\n\n1. **Connection Pooling**: Configure connection pooling for better performance:\n   ```typescript\n   const prisma = new PrismaClient({\n     log: ['query', 'info', 'warn', 'error'],\n     datasources: {\n       db: {\n         url: process.env.DATABASE_URL + '&connection_limit=20'\n       }\n     }\n   });\n   ```\n\n2. **Query Optimization**: Use `select` to fetch only needed fields:\n   ```typescript\n   const user = await prisma.user.findUnique({\n     where: { id: 1 },\n     select: {\n       id: true,\n       name: true,\n       email: true\n     }\n   });\n   ```\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Prisma ORM Documentation](/orm/v7)\n- [Prisma Schema Reference](/orm/v7/reference/prisma-schema-reference)\n- [Prisma Client API Reference](/orm/v7/reference/prisma-client-reference)\n- [Prisma Migrate Guide](/orm/v7/prisma-migrate)\n- [Prisma Studio](https://www.prisma.io/studio)\n\n## Getting Help\n\nIf you encounter issues during migration:\n1. Search the [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/prisma/prisma/issues)\n2. Ask for help in the [Prisma Slack](https://slack.prisma.io/)\n3. Open a [GitHub Discussion](https://github.com/prisma/prisma/discussions)","numLines":40,"startLine":333,"totalLines":373}}}
